steps:
STEP 1 — PatientDashboard.jsx: Near the top of the file add state variables:
  const [showFactors, setShowFactors] = useState(false);
  const [showSimulator, setShowSimulator] = useState(false);
  const [simParams, setSimParams] = useState({});
  const [simResult, setSimResult] = useState(null);
  const [simLoading, setSimLoading] = useState(false);
  const [simError, setSimError] = useState('');
  Also store factors from result: after setResult(response.data), factors are already in response.data.factors.

STEP 3 — PatientDashboard.jsx: Add 'What If?' button below the 'Why this score?' button (visible when result exists). When clicked: setShowSimulator(true); setSimParams build initial params from current form state matching the selected disease:
  Heart: {systolic_bp: systolicBp, diastolic_bp: diastolicBp, cholesterol, max_heart_rate: maxHeartRate}
  Diabetes: {glucose, hba1c, bmi}
  Cancer: {alcohol, exposure: toxinExposure, smoking}
  Also copy common params: age, gender, family_history, smoking.
